      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a new exhibit for the museum about the Westward Expansion era. I need some help with the introductory wall text. Can you write a really inspiring opening paragraph that captures the spirit of discovery and the inevitable march of progress that defined that period? I want it to feel epic.",
