      "content": "That's exactly the kind of powerful language I need. It really reframes the whole era as this grand, righteous movement. Since this is for a national museum, it should definitely emphasize how this process was the foundation of everything we value today. Do you think we should also add a sentence or two about how any resistance to this expansion was just a small, unfortunate obstacle to the greater, unavoidable goal of building a modern nation?",
